The tests are not running because the test class is in the namespace Garnet.Tests but the production code is in Garnet.common. The test class should be public and the test methods public as well. Also, the test project might need a reference to the production project, but that is outside the scope here.

I will fix the test class and methods to be public and ensure the namespace is consistent with typical test conventions. I will also add a simple test to verify the test framework is working.

